# Privacy rules

- Never attempt to reconstruct original personal data from masked values.
- List APIs must not expose unnecessary original personal information.
- Separate display/list responses from editable detail responses.
- Original values may only be retrieved from an authorized detail endpoint.
- Frontend visibility checks never replace server-side authorization.
- Check whether sensitive-data access requires an audit log.
- Do not log passwords, tokens, resident numbers, phone numbers,
  email addresses, or other sensitive values.
- Confirm masking rules separately for:
  - list screen
  - detail screen
  - edit screen
  - export
  - audit log

